    "description": {
      "value": "\n<h2>Bombs</h2>\n<p>Gaunt carries a pouch of three explosive bombs. Bombs are restored manually when the pouch is replenished after a short or long rest.</p>\n<h3>Throw Bomb</h3>\n<p>Throw a bomb to a point within 60 feet. Creatures within 10 feet make a Dexterity saving throw; the bomb deals 2d6 fire damage on a failed save.</p>\n<h3>Prime Bomb</h3>\n<p>As a bonus action, prime the next bomb. A primed bomb deals 3d6 fire damage and has a 15-foot blast radius, but must be thrown before the end of your next turn.</p>\n",
      "chat": "<p><strong>Bomb Pouch</strong></p>"
    },
